---
config:
  flowchart:
    nodeSpacing: 40
    rankSpacing: 20
---
flowchart LR
classDef general fill:#FFE86D,stroke:#CBB333,color:#574900
classDef terminator fill:#DDDDD8,stroke:#A8A8A0,color:#434339
c(["Created"]):::terminator
r["Running"]:::general
w["Waiting"]:::general
t(["Terminated"]):::terminator
c -->|"SelfTerminating,<br/>RunThenWait,<br/>Synchronous"| r
c -->|RequiresControl| w
w --->|"relay.Run<br/>or Unpause"| r
r -->|"run done:<br/>RunThenWait,<br/>RequiresControl"| w
r -->|"run done:<br/>SelfTerminating"| t
r -->|Terminate| t
w -->|Terminate| t
